<title>USA: Gilman &amp; Ciocia Q1 shr Sept 30 loss $0.10.</title>
<headline>Gilman &amp; Ciocia Q1 shr Sept 30 loss $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.10   profit	 $0.01</p>
