<p>Note: Full company name is Gilman &amp; Ciocia Inc.</p>
<p>Note: Gilman &amp; Ciocia's losses for the quarter ended Sept. 30, 1996, were attributable to increased costs related to the staffing of 44 tax preparation offices which the company opened during January of 1996, increasing the total number of offices by 56 percent as compared to the prior period.</p>
